  <h1>Hey! I'm Théo,</h1>
  <p>
    a Machine Learning Engineer from Barcelona, currently based in Berlin where
    I work at <a href="https://ai-coustics.com" target="_blank">ai-coustics</a> on
    voice AI models that improve audio quality and downstream transcription accuracy.
    Before that I interned at <a href="https://soundcloud.com" target="_blank"
      >SoundCloud</a
    > on large-scale audio recommendation pipelines, and spent two years at <a
      href="https://getsilt.com/en"
      target="_blank">Silt</a
    > building computer vision models for digital ID verification.
  </p>
  <p>
    I hold a master's in <a
      href="https://www.upf.edu/web/smc"
      target="_blank">Sound and Music Computing</a
    > from Universitat Pompeu Fabra and a bachelor's in <a
      href="https://www.upc.edu/en/bachelors/informatics-engineering-barcelona-fib"
      target="_blank">Computer Science</a
    > from Universitat Politècnica de Catalunya.
  </p>
  <p>
    Music has always been a big part of my life. In my free time you'll often
    find me at the piano or making songs under <a
      href="https://open.spotify.com/artist/0Lg9znqqYCcQl1elhFcdIV?si=0zeU7fAfSMGYgBB4sZuPsg"
      target="_blank">Tofu Wizard</a
    >.
  </p>
